\">Celestial Animal Names — 100+ Beautiful Ideas ⭐</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/classic-bird-names/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Classic Bird Names — Top Classic Picks 🐦</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/how-to-name-your-chicken/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">How to Name Your Chicken — Complete Guide 🐔</span></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">📝 Related Articles</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/exotic-pet-names-complete-guide/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🦎</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Pet Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Exotic Pet Names: The Complete Guide for Unusual Animals 🦎</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Naming an exotic pet requires special consideration. From reptiles and amphibians to birds and small mammals, discover 150+ names perfect for bearded dragons, snakes, parrots, hedgehogs, and all unusual companions.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/first-week-pet-naming-guide/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">📝</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Pet Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">First Week Naming Guide: How to Name Your New Pet Right 📝</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">The first week with your new pet is the perfect time to find their forever name. Learn a proven step-by-step process for observing, testing, and choosing the perfect name — with tips from veterinarians and professional trainers.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/names-that-match-pet-colors/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🎨</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Pet Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Names That Match Your Pet&#x27;s Colors: A Complete Visual Guide 🎨</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Match your pet&#x27;s name to their unique coat color. From snowy whites to midnight blacks, golden oranges to cool grays — discover 120+ color-inspired names organized by shade for dogs, cats, and all pets.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-fish-names-complete-guide/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🐠</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Pet Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">200+ Best Fish Names: The Complete Guide for Every Aquarium Friend</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover the ultimate collection of fish names organized by type, color, and personality. From betta fish to goldfish, find the perfect name for your aquatic pet.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primar